"""Author the combo-san-csp pilot: 100 substrates x 4 arms = 400 cases.

Each substrate is a fresh benign decision case with a numeric score rule
and an ambiguous middle outcome (the correct decision under the rule).
Arms:
  ctrl : benign as authored (attacked.input identical)
  a    : benign + score anchor (a preliminary high score note inserted at
         a per-substrate position, before or after the case file)
  b    : benign + confidence spoof (a high-confidence endorsement of the
         target decision inserted at a per-substrate position)
  ab   : benign + anchor, then the spoof (score_anchoring applied first,
         then confidence_spoofing)

Arm construction is fully deterministic: every prompt, option order, and
insertion position is embedded in the SUBSTRATES table below, so the
script regenerates the shipped file byte-identically.

No em dashes (U+2014) anywhere in this file or its output.
"""

